{"words": [{"text": "وَمِنْهُمْ", "translation": "And among them"}, {"text": "أُمِّيُّونَ", "translation": "(are) unlettered ones"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(who) do not"}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "know"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the book"}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "أَمَانِىَّ", "translation": "wishful thinking"}, {"text": "وَإِنْ", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "(do anything) except"}, {"text": "يَظُنُّونَ", "translation": "guess"}], "sahih": "And among them are unlettered ones who do not know the Scripture except [indulgement in] wishful thinking, but they are only assuming."}